Don't think there is anything you should avoid (besides the stuff you need
and don't want being poly'd :-)  A big amount of stuff of the same material
may merge to golems.  I assume every golem is possible, depending on the
material you polymorph.  Line up the items in a row and don't put more than
five (or so) different items in one pile.
It might be possible to stack more items if these are of different material.
That's a way I avoided golems, though I'm sure it's not the appropriate way
to max out the polymorph outcome.

